Understand Important Users:
===========================
1.*** "SYS" : Most powerful account.

Analogy: God User.

Owns:
Data Dictionary
Internal Oracle Objects
Core Database Objects
---------------------------------------------------------------------
2.*** "SYSTEM": Administrative account.

Used for DBA activities.

Analogy: Super Administrator
---------------------------------------------------------------------
3. XDB: XML Database functionality.
---------------------------------------------------------------------
4. CTXSYS: Oracle Text indexing.

Used for:
Full-text searches
---------------------------------------------------------------------
5. MDSYS: Spatial data.
Maps and GIS support.
---------------------------------------------------------------------
6. AUDSYS: Auditing information.
